NexVM — third-party component inventory

Linked into NexVM: none (Swift standard library and Apple system frameworks only).

Executed as a separate, user-installed process (not bundled, not linked):
- QEMU (qemu-system-aarch64, qemu-img) — GPL-2.0-only per Homebrew metadata; https://www.qemu.org/
  Obtain separately (e.g. `brew install qemu`). See docs/decisions/0003-qemu-external-process-licensing.md.

Never redistributed by this project: Windows ISOs, Windows keys, virtio-win drivers, proprietary firmware.

Secure Boot UEFI (edk2/AAVMF, BSD-2-Clause-Patent, includes OpenSSL under Apache-2.0) is read from a user-installed
location and not bundled. Tested with Ubuntu `qemu-efi-aarch64` 2024.02-2ubuntu0.10.

If any component is bundled in the future, add its name, version, license, source offer and
attribution here before release.
